B. MA-3550.XI.A.13.D., Driving Records: Drivers with more than two chargeable accidents or moving violations in the last three years or who have had one or more driver's license suspensions or revocations within the past five years cannot transport Medicaid beneficiaries.
A. MA-3550.VIII, Determining Need for Transportation Services: This section has been reorganized and language has been updated.
Additional subsections have been added to aid in locating specific topics.
Information regarding failure to complete the assessment has been moved from subsection A. to subsection E., Failure to complete the assessment.
